# ~/.bashrc.local  -*- mode: sh -*-
#
# Machine-local bash settings, NOT shared between machines. ~/.bashrc sources
# this file near its end (after ble.sh, carapace and fzf are set up), so
# anything here overrides the shared config.
#
# The repository only tracks this commented template (added with `git add -f`);
# put real per-machine settings below it and never commit them.
#
# Once per clone, hide local edits from git:
#   git -C ~ update-index --skip-worktree .bashrc.local
# (undo with --no-skip-worktree, e.g. to update this template).
